# "Midnight Groove" — Deep House
# BeatForge Studio

bpm 124
swing 15
steps 32
kit 808

# Master
reverb 0.30
delay 0.25
enhancer 0.20
width 1.25

# Drums — 4-on-floor with groove
kick     "x...x...x...x...x...x...x...x..."
clap     "....x.......x.......x.......x..."
hh       "..x...x...x...x...x...x...x...x."
oh       "......x.......x.......x.......x."
rim      "x.......x.......x.......x......."
perc     "..x..x....x..x....x..x....x..x.."

# Drum mix
vol kick 0.90
vol clap 0.65
vol hh 0.40
vol oh 0.30
vol rim 0.25
vol perc 0.20
pan hh 0.20
pan oh -0.20
pan perc 0.35
sendverb clap 0.35
senddly oh 0.20
sidechain kick hh

# Rolling bass
scale C minor
note "C2 C2 G2 G2 Ab2 Ab2 Eb2 Eb2 F2 F2 C2 C2 G2 G2 ~ ~ C2 C2 G2 G2 Ab2 Ab2 Eb2 Eb2 F2 F2 C2 C2 ~ ~ ~ ~"

# Chord stabs
chord "Cm Fm Gm Cm"
